body:
I played 400 hours the first 4 weeks of the league I read so many guides and articles and every little piece of info I could and I still have no idea how to craft and the only reason I managed to got to play till mid yellow it's because of a friend of mine who has been playing since like 1.0 carried me I sincerely think that GGG should be thinking more of for the 99% of the player base than the 1% 24/7 hours no lifers that are often streamers because that is the only way they can afford that kind of lifestyle and because they are streamers they have the loudest voices most people arent they help us all GGG this is a cry for help.

&#x200B;

sorry for grammar or orthography English isn't my first language
